flowchart TB
accTitle: Join sensitive-content findings to object-access evidence
accDescr: Macie content findings and previously retained CloudTrail data events are correlated by bucket and object key to identify recorded retrievals of sensitive objects.
S[(S3 object contents)]:::storage --> M[Macie discovery]:::process
M --> F[Bucket, key, sensitive-data finding]:::inputData
T[(Retained CloudTrail S3 data events)]:::storage --> G[GetObject, identity, time, bucket, key]:::inputData
F --> J[Correlate bucket and object key]:::process
G --> J
J --> O[Recorded accesses to sensitive objects]:::output
N[Logging must cover the audit period]:::warning -.-> T
